he crib whoever dealt. A short guided warm-up teaches cribbage to newcomers before the first match.\n\nThe campaign follows a traveling player up the Long Tally, a tournament tour of twenty-one named rivals running from a back-room parlor to a national championship, with house rules such as a chess clock and muggins at the higher tables. Outside the campaign, a weekly duplicate-cribbage challenge deals every player the same hands for a shared leaderboard, and players can face the AI at four difficulty levels or play one-on-one online.", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/double-skunk", "videos": [{"id": 198560, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "0FThqVrYBfA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0FThqVrYBfA", "title": "Double Skunk Cribbage Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0FThqVrYBfA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}